@startuml Comment_Sequence
actor User
participant Browser
participant AppServer
participant PostService
participant PostRepository
participant CommentRepository
participant DB

User -> Browser: enter comment and submit
Browser -> AppServer: POST /feed/{id}/comment { content }
AppServer -> CommentCommand: new CommentCommand(user_id, post_id, content)
CommentCommand -> PostService: execute()
PostService -> CommentRepository: save(comment)
CommentRepository -> DB: INSERT Comment
DB --> CommentRepository: comment_id
CommentRepository --> PostService: saved comment
PostService -> PostRepository: incrementCommentCount(post_id)
PostRepository -> DB: UPDATE post.comments_count
PostService -> FeedPublisher: notify(event: comment)
FeedPublisher -> FollowerObserver: update(event)
PostService --> AppServer: saved comment info
AppServer --> Browser: JSON { success: true, comment_id: id }

note right of PostService
  CommentCommand (Command) + PostService(Facade) + CommentRepository
end note

@enduml
